From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:28:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Include the fixed-width integer headers where they are used

json11.cpp and the WebRTC AEC headers aec_core.h and echo_cancellation.h
use uint8_t, int16_t, int32_t and uint32_t without including <cstdint> or
<stdint.h>. They used to get them transitively through the C++ standard
library headers, which GCC 15's libstdc++ no longer does:

    json11.cpp:98:32: error: 'uint8_t' does not name a type
    aec_core.h:193:3: error: 'uint32_t' does not name a type
    echo_cancellation.h:40:3: error: 'int16_t' does not name a type

Include the header each file needs directly, matching the style of the
file: <cstdint> next to the other C++ headers in json11.cpp, and
<stdint.h> next to <stddef.h> in the WebRTC C-style headers.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 json11.cpp                                                  | 1 +
 webrtc_dsp/modules/audio_processing/aec/aec_core.h          | 1 +
 webrtc_dsp/modules/audio_processing/aec/echo_cancellation.h | 1 +
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/json11.cpp b/json11.cpp
index 812e610..b6c530c 100755
--- a/json11.cpp
+++ b/json11.cpp
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@
 
 #include "json11.hpp"
 #include <cassert>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <cmath>
 #include <cstdlib>
 #include <cstdio>
diff --git a/webrtc_dsp/modules/audio_processing/aec/aec_core.h b/webrtc_dsp/modules/audio_processing/aec/aec_core.h
index 35a6c9b..c1cc0d4 100644
--- a/webrtc_dsp/modules/audio_processing/aec/aec_core.h
+++ b/webrtc_dsp/modules/audio_processing/aec/aec_core.h
@@ -16,6 +16,7 @@
 #define MODULES_AUDIO_PROCESSING_AEC_AEC_CORE_H_
 
 #include <stddef.h>
+#include <stdint.h>
 
 #include <memory>
 
diff --git a/webrtc_dsp/modules/audio_processing/aec/echo_cancellation.h b/webrtc_dsp/modules/audio_processing/aec/echo_cancellation.h
index 2039347..34de302 100644
--- a/webrtc_dsp/modules/audio_processing/aec/echo_cancellation.h
+++ b/webrtc_dsp/modules/audio_processing/aec/echo_cancellation.h
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
 #include <memory>
 
 #include <stddef.h>
+#include <stdint.h>
 
 extern "C" {
 #include "common_audio/ring_buffer.h"
-- 
